<topic template="Default" modified="2026-11-17T13:44:50.960Z" lasteditedby="robert" version="2" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../helpproject.xsd">
  <title>SET DIRECTORY Command</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET DIRECTORY command</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">SET DIRECTORY Command</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">用途</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">指定用于文件操作的默认文件夹（和驱动器）。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">语法</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">SET DIRECTORY TO [&lt;FolderName&gt;]</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参数</para>
    <para styleclass="List">&lt;FolderName&gt;<tab />文件夹的名称。该名称可以带引号或不带引号指定。如果省略文件夹名称，则默认文件夹将被清空。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">备注</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">SET DIRECTORY TO 是 <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_DEFAULT">SET DEFAULT TO</link> 的同义词。</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参见</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_DEFAULT">SET DEFAULT</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_PATH">SET PATH</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_CHDIR">CHDIR</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\Overload_XSharp_Core_Functions_SetDefault.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">SetDefault()</link></para>
  </body>
</topic>
